(module mixxtape_parts:LED-SMD_4P-L1.6-W1.5_XL-1615RGBC-2812B (layer F.Cu) (tedit 68B2A100)
	(descr "XINGLIGHT XL-1615RGBC-2812B, WS2812B-protocol RGB LED, 1.6 x 1.5 mm, LCSC C5349954. Land pattern taken from LCSC/EasyEDA library data for C5349954: 4 pads 0.80 x 0.65 mm at (+/-0.75, +/-0.45). PIN NUMBERS ARE THE MANUFACTURER'S: 1=GND 2=DIN 3=VDD 4=DOUT - NOT the 1=DO 2=GND 3=DI 4=VDD order used by Worldsemi and by the WS2812B-2020 footprint this replaces. The matching symbol was renumbered to agree. Do not renumber one without the other.")
	(tags "LED RGB WS2812B addressable 1615")
